{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GENERAL THEME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you are a militaria collector starting in Europe, looking for items by metal detecting, auctions or going to markets. You can also travel across the world to find relics from different locations from various conflicts in history.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RESTORING ITEMS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you find a a gun by digging it up in the woods, it is obviously rusted and may be missing parts. You need to clean up the rust, clean the wood parts and find parts to fully restore it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPAND YOUR COLLECTION, CUSTOMIZE YOUR HOME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With hundreds of different items to collect, no collection will be the same. Collect and display items that fit your interests.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3997240?t=1772613658","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997240/db92944db5a13b0d2cb26e9e6000ff61ef12d673/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772613658","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997240/5098b219c65ee791e61565eb91be3dad08019c71/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772613658","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997240/5098b219c65ee791e61565eb91be3dad08019c71/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772613658","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GENERAL THEME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you are a militaria collector starting in Europe, looking for items by metal detecting, auctions or going to markets. You can also travel across the world to find relics from different locations from various conflicts in history.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RESTORING ITEMS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you find a a gun by digging it up in the woods, it is obviously rusted and may be missing parts. You need to clean up the rust, clean the wood parts and find parts to fully restore it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPAND YOUR COLLECTION, CUSTOMIZE YOUR HOME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With hundreds of different items to collect, no collection will be the same. Collect and display items that fit your interests.</p>","developers":["Cup"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997240/674047936ffdc9ed38dc5f62831348f0ef360971/header.jpg?t=1772613658","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3997240/1818743611/2dba4fb93de924a39d1366c3a45e52a83aae702f/1756471196/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758305654","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3997240/1818743611/2dba4fb93de924a39d1366c3a45e52a83aae702f/1756471196/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758305654","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3997240/1818743611/2dba4fb93de924a39d1366c3a45e52a83aae702f/1756471196/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758305654","id":257190703,"name":"Osta short trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257190703/11888cb1f4af54ac035cbafa9860abe92ac70d03/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758305654"}],"name":"Osta","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 660 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul cla